**Architecture patterns:**

- All slash commands (no prefix commands)
- Persistent Views re-registered on `on_ready` for button components
- Channel/role routing via `cogs/guild_registry.py` logical keys — not per-guild hardcoded IDs in cogs
- Dual guild: ShadowMain + ShadowBackup — every feature, panel, and Discord change must mirror both (see `shadow-dual-guild.mdc`). Deploy scripts default `--guild all`; never ship Main-only without Joseph's explicit opt-out.

When given a cog to work on, read the whole file before touching anything.

